P_SCHEMA ..> P_DATA : projects logical types
P_SCHEMA ..> P_JSON : parses JSON schemas
P_IDENT ..> P_CBOR : emits tagged trees
P_IDENT ..> P_ENV : tags envelope scalars
P_IDENT ..> P_DATA : tags core values
P_PLAN ..> P_CBOR : encodes / decodes
P_PLAN ..> P_IDENT : tagged values
P_PLAN ..> P_DATA : carries types / values
P_RT ..> P_IDENT : addresses work
P_RT ..> P_PLAN : uses
